G90 ; use absolute coordinates
G21 ; millimeter units
G28 ; home all axes
G1 Z120 F6000 ; raise to camera height

; move to scan start corner
G1 X20 Y20 F6000

; boustrophedon raster scan (16 rows)
G1 X330 Y20 F3000 ; row 0
G4 P100 ; let camera settle
G1 X330 Y40 F3000
G1 X20 Y40 F3000 ; row 1
G4 P100 ; let camera settle
